<title>USA: St Johns County IDA, Fla., yields 5.875 in 2023.</title>
<headline>St Johns County IDA, Fla., yields 5.875 in 2023.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>William R. Hough &amp; Co said it repriced $26.175 million of St Johns County Industrial Development Authority, Fla., industrial development revenue bonds, Series 1996, with a top yield of 5.875 percent in 2023.</p>
